                <text type="information">For information on preparing for bushfires go to www.cfs.sa.gov.au.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">Fresh north to northeast winds combined with hot and dry conditions Monday are expected to result in extreme fire danger over parts of the West Coast district from the late morning. A fresh and gusty cool southwesterly change is expected over the far west during the morning and moving through eastern parts of the West Coast district during the afternoon. Showers and thunderstorms are possible from the morning ahead of the change.</text>
